docs {
  What redaction looks like when the value is real. Bruno mirrors a query
  parameter into the `url` line as well as into `params:query`, so both are held
  to the same rule: `api_key` keeps its name and loses its value in the table
  AND in the URL above it, and the try-it box for it opens empty rather than
  prefilled.

  The key in the file is not a live one. It is here so this page can be read
  against the source it was built from.
}
